-- Bases of a topology: every open set is a union of basis sets, the
-- topology generated by a family satisfying the basis axioms, closure,
-- interior, and continuity tested on a basis, bases of subspaces and
-- products, and the open balls as a basis of the real line
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
